"t": "Björck M, et al. Editor's Choice – ESVS 2020 Clinical Practice Guidelines on the Management of Acute Limb Ischaemia. Eur J Vasc Endovasc Surg 2020;59:173–218",
"u": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejvs.2019.09.006"
